{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_03",
  "title": "临时停车",
  "storyCode": "RS-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c31d59186439dc3c61123c2e84e04b53a26554c42393b57606a2feb95e37289a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列车到达终点站——\n银心湖站。\n银心湖地处盆地中央，湖面雾霭氤氲，水质清澈，是谢拉格土地上孕育出的众多瑰宝之一。\n传说银心湖是耶拉冈德落下的第一滴眼泪，在冬季，您可以于冰封的湖面上漫步，透过冰面，还可以观赏冰层深处的风景。\n而最新建起的耶拉冈德像伫立于银心湖的湖心岛之上，耶拉冈德在此，注视着谢拉格与其子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "各位乘客，本次列车......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......所以，一切都是误会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有隐情，没有追杀，没有什么可能在车上的重要人物，什么都没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你指的是让我登上这趟列车的“重要人物”，那就是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "短短一个月就在牧民间扬名，擅长医治驮兽的哈洛德·克雷加文子爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的荣幸，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请您原谅，锏女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您手套上的血迹，实在令人难以不多做一些设想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血迹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很在意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么在意，告诉你也无妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "洗耳恭听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莉莉生产时的情况不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "突然早产，出血量很大，费了我不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早产......出血量还不少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可不是小事，锏女士，莉莉她现在情况如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我替她做了应急处理，但后续的护理还需要专业人士来做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老雷昂指名说最信得过你，克雷加文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之后就要看你的本事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好！我立刻就赶过去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你现在的表情有点遗憾。怎么，不符合你的想象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系，我不介意让你的想象成真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就不必了，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说说看，你们都误会了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个......哈哈，银心湖真是个不错的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天的天气也不错，风和日丽，空气清新......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......维多利亚人连转移话题都要谈论天气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这种套话我听过一万次，腻了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请您见谅，在维多利亚，我们会从小学习如何靠我们糟糕的天气来开启话题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请您不要随便抹黑维多利亚的形象，子爵阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们怎么还在这傻站着聊天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是有点小误会吗，你们说开了没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是某些人危言耸听，也不至于产生这样的误会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行吧，你们都解决了就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然在列车上跑跑挺有趣的，但我不想再蹲在桌子底下吃灰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，我刚刚去前面看了看，那边有导游姐姐指路，我还要了两张地图来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这儿离银心湖就一条街的距离，方便得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么说，我们现在出发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......我很抱歉，罗莎琳，我无法兑现之前的承诺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在有一位更加需要我的女士，我必须尽快赶到她的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......莉莉真的是驮兽吧？不是什么，维多利亚贵族的黑话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我求您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，知道了，你还是赶紧去看看那位“莉莉女士”吧，我这没啥，我自己一个人完全没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗莎琳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你怎么了，干嘛这副表情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真是个善解人意的好姑娘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来，让我们先交换一下联络方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果遇到困难，随时可以联系我，哈洛德乐意为你效劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有你的父亲......谢拉格美男子，对吧？我也会帮你留意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就多谢了，大叔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们继续聊吧，我先走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，多好的孩子，刚刚失去母亲，却还能如此乐观，如此坚强......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谢拉格美男子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，您听到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗莎琳这孩子这趟来谢拉格，就是想要找到多年未见的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是感人，希望她能一切顺利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个女孩是这么说的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然误会已经解开，那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "锏女士，我是您忠实的支持者，不知可否赏脸签名——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先走了，你记得照顾好莉莉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，且慢，请留步，锏女士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这就走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的黑骑士女士看起来并不喜欢那段辉煌的过往经历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也难怪，她毕竟是以那样的方式被卡西米尔驱逐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，不好意思，原来你还在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不想随意发言，惹怒那位黑骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很有自知之明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发言确实应当更加谨慎，这是我的失误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，子爵阁下，您当真相信锏女士给出的理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑骑士自脱离卡西米尔，跟随希瓦艾什前往谢拉格以来，一直都是其手下的心腹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "据我所知，这位女士最近一段时间，都在某座山中，为喀兰贸易训练一批新式部队。"
