      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好多游客都爱往上跑，要挂什么证明感情的金锁......哎，对了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说阿克托斯老爷挺爱上山打猎，好几次被游客打扰了，还很不高兴呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，我知道了，谢了老板，这是干酪的钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特产商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是妈妈经常提起的银心湖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有那座山，弗根山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "风景确实还不错，嗯，不过这种程度的冰湖乌萨斯也不是没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，冰层还挺厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边那个看不清脸的......就是耶拉冈德像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇哦，好高，好大的工程，这么大的雕像真不知道得用掉多少石头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "石头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的耶拉冈德像可没有那么简单！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这人还挺懂欣赏的嘛，这里可是观赏耶拉冈德像最好的地点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，你哪位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我是——\n咳、咳嗯！我是谁不重要，重要的是你刚刚说的话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座耶拉冈德像才不是用普通石头建造的，为表示对耶拉冈德的敬爱，我们用的材料可都是最高等级的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最高等级？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "具体是指啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀都说了最高等级，当然就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了，咬到舌头了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这种事当然是要保密了，怎么能轻易告诉游客呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "关于材料，详细的我不能告诉你，但总之......总之很厉害就对了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你刚刚不是还差点说漏嘴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我最后没说出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好，你没说出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你慢慢在这欣赏，我先走了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，喂！你等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有啥事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你......\n呃，对了！你是游客吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "两天后的早晨，就在这里，会举办耶拉冈德像的落成仪式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果那时候你还在谢拉格，一定要记得来观礼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么这么自说自话啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "两天后的事情还说不定呢，现在看看不也一样吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那怎么能一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可是圣女大人会亲自出席主持的仪式，搞不好真能看到耶拉冈德显灵呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......对了，你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗莎琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "全名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这么麻烦......\n（乌萨斯语）罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，罗莎琳！我邀请你！这样行不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我休露丝·布朗陶正式邀请你，罗莎琳·塔季扬诺夫娜·拉里娜！参加两天后的耶拉冈德像落成仪式！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到时候你就会知道，这座耶拉冈德像是最特别的，和其他的都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么有自信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊，那我就拭目以待了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，等等，我还没给你邀请函呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这家伙......跑这么快干嘛啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休露丝，布朗陶家家主的妹妹，近年来作为使节频繁代表谢拉格出使他国。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道说，罗莎琳是她从中安排的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "应该想办法窃听的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，你已经拿着你的破报纸在我的摊位面前站了五分钟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店主",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是不买东西的话能不能让让。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，抱歉，请给我来一杯驮兽奶茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样应该就算完成菈塔托丝那个臭女人的吩咐了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忽然要我盯着个小丫头，还要想办法继续接触对方......莫名其妙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，这小丫头，仔细一看还真是有点眼熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "露丝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的不用我帮忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤卡坦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事情交给我，你还有什么不放心的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，我们回去，我可要好好问问菈塔托丝，这个叫罗莎琳的小丫头到底是什么来头！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
